SUMMARY:The Metropolitan Opera: Macbeth (2026)
LOCATION:Kendall Square\, 355 Binney St\, Cambridge\, MA 02142
DESCRIPTION:Two of opera’s most extraordinary artists return to The Met: 
 Live in HD for Verdi’s thrilling take on the immortal Shakespearean tale
  of the scheming couple determined to seize power at any cost. Baritone Qu
 inn Kelsey is the Scottish king haunted by the ghosts of his murderous asc
 ent to the throne\, opposite soprano Lise Davidsen as the power-mad Lady M
 acbeth\, whose ruinous ambition damns them both. Met Music Director Yannic
 k Nézet-Séguin takes the podium for a penetrating production by Louisa P
 roske. Rounding out the all-star cast are tenor Freddie De Tommaso as Macd
 uff and bass-baritone Ryan Speedo Green as Banquo.\nhttps://booking.landma
 rktheatres.com/launch/ticketing/de30cd43-9bdd-53f9-9a3c-21fe5f739fd5\nFrom
  Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
URL:https://booking.landmarktheatres.com/launch/ticketing/de30cd43-9bdd-53f
 9-9a3c-21fe5f739fd5
END:VEVENT
